---
Fix sample browser audition race condition.

When clicking a sample in the browser to preview it, the audition triggers
a sample load on the GUI thread while the audio thread may be reading
the same sample slot. This can cause use-after-free or torn reads.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Audition sample loading does not race with audio thread reads
- [ ] Audition uses a dedicated buffer or double-buffering approach
- [ ] No glitch or crash when rapidly clicking different samples to preview
- [ ] Previous audition is cleanly stopped before starting a new one

## Test Plan
- [ ] Rapid-click through 10+ samples in browser, verify no crash
- [ ] TSan run: audition during playback shows no data races
- [ ] Audition while pattern is playing, verify both sound correctly
